<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military launched airstrikes on a displacement camp in Rakhine state, killing 12 people including a five-year-old and injuring many others, and later carried out a double-tap strike on civilians. Junta forces also bombed villages, destroyed bridges and advanced west of the Sittaung River, forcing further civilian flight. ASEAN members continue to affirm a constructive and principled engagement with Myanmar under the Five Point Consensus, while the bloc remains divided over easing restrictions on the junta. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOelhQTXluM0EyUV9QWEJ4NFdkWk5NQVFzTm5kWUFyQkk3UXdUMlVsOVFlNmpNMzZ1ZVlDYy1nbldweC00RW1uQnFQU1NnT0RzNTZzS3ZHN0w5RDZiQ1dOVjlkZk03djltN1VEZUlNci14NFdSYXRqZEZLbzNFZ2dSbUNCcW9ZQl9ZSmdTcXdkd05raUJoZl9INTh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNb2plekZ4aE15TUFLemFKblVBdWYySzdRMHNRbmhpZjc2dkxQOWxHMG9qQmQxUFpfNTRkcHNWYkNKQXVveUtnSUxqNG00Q2hjQ0lJWWZaMUc4RUxkVWtUOGZhQUk0MGJEUHVuSDRkZmFSZ2x5VFR0bFUzOVl1OVE0R0lBR2RYZHpIdE4wYzRyZ3haRjZweFhPVVpZNF91Ynpad1k1T0RXUndNNXQzb2xEcXNyaUVJd1Y3Z1lIWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;تسنیم&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOS0g4Vkk0YUhuV0VRc0QwaDB0eFdkeUp6QkRydVE2RWg2X05KZXVBNjJkejFwM0RtNXhhcTNHWElUbmNvRmQ4MXgyemNVUGU0LWxFVWNRV3h0VnhuQkxKRlN1Vy1yOWppV08tdS1UeFpOMjVqYU9NaGV4LXZxQjJJUS1FbzBQcktNYjRoMDFsNXVkM2c5ZHBGV3pBdmJBc1JwMjlSV1FlS0M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Business Standard&lt